and 1x channel with host interface.

Add the EHCI, OHCI, USB2.0 PHY and reset control nodes for USB2.0 channels
in R9A09G047 SoC DTSI.

Signed-off-by: Tommaso Merciai <tommaso.merciai.xr@bp.renesas.com>
