|                | Size | Time (before) | Time (after) | Time Reduction |
|                +------+---------------+--------------+----------------+
| Plug Memory    | 256G |      10s      |      3s      |       70%      |
|                +------+---------------+--------------+----------------+
|                | 512G |      36s      |      7s      |       81%      |
+----------------+------+---------------+--------------+----------------+

+----------------+------+---------------+--------------+----------------+
|                | Size | Time (before) | Time (after) | Time Reduction |
|                +------+---------------+--------------+----------------+
| Unplug Memory  | 256G |      11s      |      4s      |       64%      |
|                +------+---------------+--------------+----------------+
|                | 512G |      36s      |      9s      |       75%      |
+----------------+------+---------------+--------------+----------------+

